 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? It can, depending on how you use it. Watching a few episodes in a row is a great way to start, as you can follow the story without getting lost. That's okay. Focus on story and the characters for now. You' remember the words they say when they repeat them, and looking up a few new words is fine. Six to eight is enough to make real progress without overwhelming yourself. Depends how busy you are. A few minutes a day is better than nothing, but six to eight episodes is more drama. Great choice. Let me know how it goes.",
